{"id":"n64514-1-6","stage":2,"title":"군데 · 处","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64514-1-6-1","ko":"이 밤에 문을 연 식당이 있을까?","zh":"这晚上还有开门的餐厅吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"밤에","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤에","audio":"/audio/9f09f2292c491f4b1b56.mp3"}},{"text":"문을","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문을","audio":"/audio/e9d89a0e3afa5573f056.mp3"}},{"text":"연","meaning":"开张，开门","explanation":"열다：开张，开门；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"3","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연","audio":"/audio/bda2e47c418666075e2f.mp3"}},{"text":"식당이","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식당이","audio":"/audio/7fb3ef89763c2688893b.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까","audio":"/audio/263e0eb545ea59d74b53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"开张，开门","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"开始一天的营业。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/788db669e78039343f05.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64514-1-6-2","ko":"찾아보면 그래도 한두 군데 있을 거야.","zh":"稍微找找的话，应该还是有一两家吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"찾아보면","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아보면","audio":"/audio/f4e9d90cb0874adda92a.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"한두","meaning":"一两个","explanation":"한두：